WEBVTT

00:03.097 --> 00:05.257
[ALBERT]
Ray, we've been expecting you.

00:06.267 --> 00:08.687
[chuckles]
Oh, yeah, it's about time.

00:09.227 --> 00:10.307
I'm sorry, guys.

00:11.347 --> 00:13.307
I have no choice
but to take you both down.

00:13.397 --> 00:15.187
♪

00:17.397 --> 00:18.687
[grunts]

00:18.777 --> 00:21.987
[yells]

00:23.827 --> 00:25.577
Going full power
from the start, huh?

00:25.657 --> 00:28.247
Yeah, gonna use all I got.

00:28.327 --> 00:30.167
Fancy strategies
won't do for you.

00:33.537 --> 00:34.957
Al, do it!

00:35.037 --> 00:36.707
[grunts]

00:41.547 --> 00:44.467
Good try, but it's not
good enough. [gasps]

00:46.307 --> 00:48.137
[RAY] Really? You're kidding.

00:53.227 --> 00:55.107
Go, Aurum Reverse.

00:56.107 --> 00:57.937
[AMELIA]
Ariane, it's now or never.

00:58.027 --> 00:59.737
[ARIANE]
Sure you wanna go all in?

00:59.817 --> 01:02.737
[AMELIA] Look at his
materia field. It's insane.

01:02.817 --> 01:05.947
We can't take any chances
with an opponent like him.

01:06.027 --> 01:07.077
I understand.

01:09.237 --> 01:10.157
[electricity crackling]

01:10.537 --> 01:11.827
Ogre!

01:12.667 --> 01:13.867
[grunts]

01:15.207 --> 01:16.667
That was quite the display.

01:16.747 --> 01:18.377
And you've got real power
to back it up.

01:19.007 --> 01:20.627
But you're no match for me.

01:22.217 --> 01:23.127
[groans]

01:24.837 --> 01:26.677
[gasps] Amelia!

01:27.597 --> 01:29.517
The Butterfly Effect won't stop!

01:31.227 --> 01:35.397
Eighth Secret Blade Technique,
Afterglow Blackout.

01:35.477 --> 01:37.517
[both groan]

01:43.397 --> 01:44.987
I didn't expect that.

01:45.067 --> 01:47.617
If we're just talking
about your code assembly skill,

01:47.697 --> 01:50.407
you'd be up there
with the Seven Grand Sorcerers.

01:51.077 --> 01:52.077
Give it up.

01:52.157 --> 01:53.157
This world's causality

01:53.247 --> 01:55.287
has already been established,
you know.

01:55.367 --> 01:56.417
Hmm.

01:56.497 --> 01:58.417
[crowd cheering]

01:59.497 --> 02:00.917
♪

02:01.007 --> 02:02.757
Such a perfect defense.

02:02.837 --> 02:05.087
Defying physics
by controlling causality.

02:05.797 --> 02:09.047
Yeah, that's just what
her Butterfly Effect does.

02:09.137 --> 02:10.217
She created a reality

02:10.307 --> 02:12.517
in which his attack doesn't
actually land.

02:13.727 --> 02:14.687
Hey, Carla,

02:14.767 --> 02:16.397
did Pinky eat something
to grow a brain,

02:16.477 --> 02:18.567
-or am I crazy?
-Eh?

02:18.647 --> 02:21.527
Your spell is an utter nuisance,
that's true.

02:23.277 --> 02:24.527
Hm, let's find out

02:24.607 --> 02:26.697
which one of us
can be the bigger pain.

02:27.407 --> 02:28.447
[chuckles]

02:28.987 --> 02:29.947
[Amelia groans]

02:30.037 --> 02:31.537
[panting]

02:34.037 --> 02:36.117
[LIESELOTTE] I see.
You've reached your limit.

02:36.207 --> 02:39.207
And with that we've found
the Butterfly Effect's weakness.

02:39.287 --> 02:40.917
The duration you can use it.

02:44.877 --> 02:45.837
Listen to me.

02:46.587 --> 02:49.427
I promise I won't let
any of his attacks hit you.

02:49.507 --> 02:51.717
So give it your all
and show him what you can do.

02:51.807 --> 02:53.347
Yes, I'm way ahead of you.

02:53.427 --> 02:54.807
[crowd cheering]

02:54.887 --> 02:57.687
Wow, looks like it's a fight
against time for both parties.

02:57.767 --> 03:00.567
I only see two possible outcomes
in this scenario.

03:00.647 --> 03:02.267
Either Ariane defeats Lucas

03:02.357 --> 03:04.357
before the Butterfly Effect
wears off.

03:04.437 --> 03:05.487
[Francoise chuckles]

03:06.027 --> 03:08.857
Or she gets tired
before he does. Is that it?

03:08.947 --> 03:11.367
[CAROL]
Hey! Don't take my commentary.

03:11.447 --> 03:12.657
That's the whole reason
I'm here.

03:12.737 --> 03:13.867
[LYDIA]
All right, Pinky, we get it.

03:13.947 --> 03:16.077
[CAROL] Don't you see?
This is my time to shine.

03:16.157 --> 03:17.957
[DINA] <i>I don't get it.</i>
<i>How do these people</i>

03:18.037 --> 03:19.497
<i>-even know each other?</i>
-[Lydia groans]

03:19.577 --> 03:22.247
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:47.147 --> 03:49.447
Ah, the infamous "lucky undies."

03:49.527 --> 03:50.777
-You know about those?
-Yes.

03:50.867 --> 03:51.817
BUTT MOCHI THEORY

03:51.907 --> 03:53.657
It's been man's finest attire
since ancient times.

03:53.737 --> 03:56.037
His creed upon his buttocks
is proof of his resolve.

03:56.117 --> 03:57.037
[LIESELOTTE] People of Arnold,

03:57.117 --> 03:59.287
I give you
the Prattfall Theorem.

04:07.257 --> 04:09.047
EPISODE 4 THE BOY WHO IS
THE WORLD'S STRONGEST SORCERER

04:09.127 --> 04:10.837
AND HIS FRIENDS
CONVERSE WITH THEIR FISTS

04:11.507 --> 04:13.427
[grunts]

04:15.257 --> 04:18.057
Good sir, would you be so kind
as to dance with me?

04:18.137 --> 04:21.187
I'm sorry to say
I've no interest in dancing.

04:21.767 --> 04:24.187
-[RAY] Aurum Reverse.
-[ALBERT] Right.

04:24.267 --> 04:26.987
While we're inside
this spell's area of effect,

04:27.067 --> 04:29.487
none of us
can use any meaningful magic.

04:29.567 --> 04:31.107
So that's what it does.

04:31.197 --> 04:32.447
[CAROL] What's going on
with these three?

04:32.527 --> 04:33.777
Let's see.

04:33.867 --> 04:35.027
-The prima materia becomes--
-[REBECCA] The spell suppressed

04:35.117 --> 04:36.747
the use of the prima materia.

04:36.827 --> 04:38.907
And it appears
to cover a wide area.

04:38.997 --> 04:40.867
-Clever move.
-[CAROL] What?

04:40.957 --> 04:42.457
Et tu, Rebecca?

04:42.537 --> 04:44.077
[DINA]
Your wit never ceases to amaze.

04:44.167 --> 04:45.457
-[Carol grumbles]
-[REBECCA] Mine? Oh, please.

04:46.207 --> 04:48.757
I'm guessing this was your plan
from the very start.

04:48.837 --> 04:50.007
[ALBERT]
There's no way we can win

04:50.087 --> 04:51.587
if you're able to use magic.

04:51.677 --> 04:53.717
And that's why
we came up with a plan

04:53.797 --> 04:55.347
that might actually
let us beat you.

04:55.427 --> 04:59.097
He's right.
Let's settle this the macho way.

04:59.177 --> 05:00.267
Sure.

05:01.597 --> 05:04.187
-Show me what you got.
-[DINA] Huh?

05:05.687 --> 05:07.727
-They're all naked?
-[FRANCOISE] Wow.

05:08.737 --> 05:10.357
-Oh, boy.
-Hooray!

05:10.447 --> 05:11.357
Really?

05:11.447 --> 05:14.657
[both yelling]

05:19.947 --> 05:21.327
[both groan]

05:22.997 --> 05:26.337
[ALBERT] This is him
with no magical enhancements.

05:26.417 --> 05:28.587
He's so far away.

05:29.547 --> 05:30.457
[Albert groans]

05:30.547 --> 05:33.217
My entire body, it hurts.

05:33.297 --> 05:35.757
Then there's the strain
from the Aurum Reverse.

05:35.887 --> 05:38.217
But still, for some reason.

05:38.307 --> 05:41.017
[chuckles] I'm so happy.

05:41.097 --> 05:42.097
What about you?

05:42.187 --> 05:44.347
[ALBERT] Me too. I feel amazing!

05:45.687 --> 05:48.357
<i>Ray, if I had never met you,</i>

05:48.437 --> 05:50.857
<i>I would still be the same</i>
<i>as before.</i>

05:50.937 --> 05:53.317
<i>Meeting you</i>
<i>is what helped me evolve.</i>

05:53.397 --> 05:54.567
<i>Which is why,</i>

05:54.657 --> 05:57.907
<i>I wanna show you how far</i>
<i>I've come by beating you.</i>

06:03.867 --> 06:05.747
[yells]

06:06.167 --> 06:07.747
[EVI] <i>Ray. Ray.</i>

06:08.167 --> 06:09.247
<i>Ray!</i>

06:09.337 --> 06:12.127
[both yelling]

06:18.597 --> 06:20.557
That's it. Lights out.

06:20.637 --> 06:22.677
You gotta take us home, Albert.

06:23.517 --> 06:25.137
[Albert groans]

06:25.977 --> 06:27.767
Bro, I got you.

06:29.017 --> 06:31.857
Huh?
I think you've hit your limit.

06:31.937 --> 06:33.027
You need to slow down.

06:34.107 --> 06:35.527
You've really changed.

06:35.607 --> 06:38.067
Come at me
with everything you've got.

06:38.157 --> 06:40.157
Albert, it's just you and me.

06:41.157 --> 06:43.327
Yeah, let's finish this.

06:43.657 --> 06:45.907
[yells]

06:48.537 --> 06:51.587
[yells]

06:55.007 --> 06:56.507
I see now.

06:56.587 --> 06:59.427
Since she's focused
on protecting you,

06:59.507 --> 07:02.847
Amelia happens to be completely
defenseless right now.

07:03.387 --> 07:05.267
<i>He's right.</i>
<i>While I'm helping her,</i>

07:05.347 --> 07:07.137
<i>I can only</i>
<i>control one causality.</i>

07:07.767 --> 07:09.357
[groans]

07:09.437 --> 07:10.817
If you wanna get to her,

07:10.897 --> 07:12.187
you're gonna have to
go through me!

07:12.727 --> 07:14.897
<i>Right now, all of his attacks</i>
<i>are nullified.</i>

07:14.987 --> 07:17.947
<i>If I want to incapacitate</i>
<i>Lucas Forst, I need to move.</i>

07:18.027 --> 07:19.157
<i>This might be my only chance.</i>

07:20.657 --> 07:21.697
[groans]

07:22.237 --> 07:24.077
[RAY] <i>You wish to use</i>
<i>sorcerer-like magic?</i>

07:24.447 --> 07:27.657
[ARIANE] Yes, I was thinking
something similar to Amelia.

07:27.747 --> 07:29.457
Would that be
too difficult for me?

07:30.167 --> 07:31.627
I'd say so.

07:31.707 --> 07:33.667
As a sorcerer, you're definitely
more suited

07:33.757 --> 07:35.207
to inside code magic.

07:35.297 --> 07:37.587
That's something dictated
by innate talent.

07:37.677 --> 07:39.677
-Ah.
-[RAY] Then again,

07:39.757 --> 07:42.217
sorcerer-like is inherently
a strange expression

07:42.307 --> 07:43.467
and distinction.

07:43.557 --> 07:45.847
Whether we're talking
about the use of inside code

07:45.927 --> 07:48.477
or outside code,
it makes no difference.

07:48.847 --> 07:49.977
Magic is magic.

07:53.147 --> 07:55.987
Besides, what you can do
really blows me away.

07:56.067 --> 07:57.027
[gasps]

07:57.107 --> 07:59.947
Your ability to handle
inside code is incredible.

08:00.027 --> 08:03.077
It's almost like a reflection
of your honest personality.

08:03.157 --> 08:05.117
Really?
You're not just saying that?

08:05.697 --> 08:07.827
If you focus on
mastering inside code,

08:07.907 --> 08:09.917
you can achieve great power.

08:09.997 --> 08:11.627
If I were you,
I wouldn't change a thing.

08:11.707 --> 08:14.547
-[grunts]
-<i>I'd just keep moving forward.</i>

08:19.927 --> 08:22.467
[ARIANE] <i>Ray is always</i>
<i>so cool and collected.</i>

08:22.547 --> 08:24.257
<i>Looking at his face,</i>
<i>you'd never know it</i>.

08:24.757 --> 08:27.017
<i>But he's got a fiery passion</i>
<i>in his heart.</i>

08:27.637 --> 08:31.147
<i>That being said, he can be</i>
<i>quite eccentric as well.</i>

08:32.107 --> 08:34.817
<i>The way he looks</i>
<i>when he's laughing with abandon,</i>

08:34.897 --> 08:36.527
<i>I just adore it.</i>

08:37.067 --> 08:39.027
<i>Oh, now I get it.</i>

08:39.107 --> 08:40.737
[grunts]

08:42.027 --> 08:43.027
[panting]

08:44.527 --> 08:46.157
[ARIANE] <i>To stay focused</i>
<i>on the tournament,</i>

08:46.287 --> 08:47.577
<i>I kept pushing it down.</i>

08:49.247 --> 08:51.877
<i>Because I felt like</i>
<i>if I was honest with myself,</i>

08:51.957 --> 08:53.037
<i>I would waver.</i>

08:53.127 --> 08:55.287
<i>That it would somehow</i>
<i>make me weaker.</i>

08:55.877 --> 08:57.667
-[thumping]
<i>-But actually,</i>

08:57.757 --> 08:59.087
<i>now that I've admitted it,</i>

08:59.167 --> 09:01.297
<i>I keep feeling stronger</i>
<i>and stronger.</i>

09:03.677 --> 09:05.847
[grunts]

09:09.637 --> 09:10.927
-[crowd cheering]
-[DINA] Incredible!

09:14.517 --> 09:16.567
Forst was finally knocked down.

09:16.647 --> 09:17.687
Like real hard.

09:18.397 --> 09:20.567
-[Ariane groans]
-[DINA] Ariane collapses,

09:20.647 --> 09:21.947
completely exhausted.

09:22.027 --> 09:24.367
[panting]

09:26.327 --> 09:28.447
[panting]

09:30.497 --> 09:31.457
[gasps]

09:33.537 --> 09:37.207
I'll admit that was close,
but time's up now.

09:37.837 --> 09:39.507
[DINA] What's this, folks?

09:39.587 --> 09:40.837
Forst is back on his feet

09:40.917 --> 09:42.927
as if he didn't just take
the beating of a lifetime

09:43.007 --> 09:44.387
from Ariane Algren!

09:44.467 --> 09:45.717
What? You're kidding me.

09:46.467 --> 09:48.427
Is Lukas Forst invincible?

09:48.507 --> 09:50.177
No. Take a good look.

09:51.057 --> 09:52.057
[Lucas groans]

09:52.137 --> 09:54.057
[DINA] Oh, his cheek is crushed.

09:54.137 --> 09:55.557
[FRANCOISE]
He's putting up a tough front.

09:55.647 --> 09:57.057
-[LIESELOTTE] That's right.
-[Ariane panting]

09:58.397 --> 09:59.687
You're still on your feet.

09:59.777 --> 10:01.187
[ARIANE] Of course I am.

10:01.277 --> 10:02.487
We can still beat you.

10:02.567 --> 10:04.107
I'm impressed.

10:04.607 --> 10:07.367
Well, there's no force stronger
than a maiden in love.

10:07.447 --> 10:08.487
Is that so?

10:09.537 --> 10:10.617
[Ariane, Amelia gasp]

10:10.947 --> 10:12.497
-[fireworks sounding]
-[Ariane, Amelia gasp]

10:17.087 --> 10:18.877
[DINA] Victory has been claimed.

10:18.957 --> 10:20.757
Your champions
of the Magicks War

10:20.837 --> 10:22.257
are Team Algren!

10:22.337 --> 10:24.507
-Albert.
-Evi.

10:24.587 --> 10:26.257
[crowd applauding]

10:26.337 --> 10:29.047
Oh, yeah! That's right.
They did it.

10:29.177 --> 10:31.017
Everybody was just so amazing.

10:31.097 --> 10:32.767
That's my big, strong Ray.

10:32.847 --> 10:34.347
Go, bro!

10:34.437 --> 10:36.477
You should
celebrate with us, Maria!

10:36.557 --> 10:38.397
Go, brother!

10:38.477 --> 10:40.267
Wouldn't that be weird
since he's not my brother?

10:40.357 --> 10:42.277
[BOTH] Big brother, let's go.

10:44.487 --> 10:46.987
Oh, Ray, you're the best.

10:48.067 --> 10:51.237
[laughs]
Did you see my Ray, Carla?

10:51.327 --> 10:52.827
Yeah, I sure did.

10:52.947 --> 10:54.787
You're so cool, it's crazy.

10:54.867 --> 10:56.417
-Go, Ray!
-[DINA] Huh?

10:56.497 --> 10:59.457
-Quite a good match indeed.
-Yes.

10:59.587 --> 11:01.707
It's been too long
since I was this entertained,

11:01.797 --> 11:02.917
-I must say.
-[CAROL] Yeah, Ray!

11:03.007 --> 11:04.667
-[Lydia sighs]
-You're Arnold's MVP.

11:04.797 --> 11:07.677
-A Carocaro guarantee!
-You did it, Ray. Wow.

11:07.757 --> 11:10.347
Amelia, did we just win?

11:10.427 --> 11:12.677
I think Ray helped us
cross the finish line.

11:13.137 --> 11:14.177
Ray.

11:14.267 --> 11:15.677
-So, Ariane.
-Huh?

11:16.347 --> 11:19.057
Ray, you were just daydreaming
about him, weren't you?

11:19.147 --> 11:21.107
[gasps] No, I...

11:21.187 --> 11:22.777
You don't
have to pretend anymore.

11:22.857 --> 11:24.817
I've known about it
for a long time.

11:24.897 --> 11:26.067
For a long time how?

11:26.487 --> 11:28.657
You mean you knew
that I had feelings for Ray

11:28.737 --> 11:31.027
before I even realized
it was true?

11:31.117 --> 11:33.117
You're way easier
to read than you think.

11:34.157 --> 11:36.457
-Yeah, well, so are you, Amelia.
-[gasps]

11:37.917 --> 11:39.707
[chuckles] You're not wrong.

11:39.787 --> 11:41.997
It seems I've fallen
head over heels for Ray.

11:43.957 --> 11:45.007
I see.

11:45.087 --> 11:47.337
Well, I guess we're rivals
in love then too.

11:47.927 --> 11:50.347
-Oh, is that true?
-Yes.

11:50.427 --> 11:52.137
Somehow the two of us
have fallen

11:52.217 --> 11:53.597
for the very same person.

11:53.677 --> 11:56.097
Amelia, you too?

11:56.677 --> 11:59.437
You've also felt
the mark Ray left, right?

11:59.517 --> 12:00.607
On your heart?

12:02.017 --> 12:03.437
I have, yes.

12:03.517 --> 12:05.687
From now on,
we may still be friends,

12:05.777 --> 12:07.857
but we're also competing
for Ray's heart.

12:07.947 --> 12:08.857
Indeed.

12:10.657 --> 12:11.617
[both gasp]

12:11.697 --> 12:13.867
[chuckles evilly]

12:13.947 --> 12:15.287
[Dina whimpering]

12:15.367 --> 12:16.707
Oh, so funny.

12:17.617 --> 12:19.827
Oh, and we can't
forget about Rebecca.

12:20.167 --> 12:21.417
No, we can't.

12:24.037 --> 12:25.127
[LUCAS] That must be him.

12:25.667 --> 12:26.967
Ah, I thought so.

12:27.507 --> 12:29.627
You certainly built
an impressive team.

12:29.717 --> 12:32.717
I was giving it everything I had
until the very end,

12:32.797 --> 12:35.637
but it looks like your side
was just one cut above mine.

12:35.717 --> 12:37.927
Too kind, but I gotta say,

12:38.017 --> 12:40.807
your team was so strong
I thought we might not win.

12:40.887 --> 12:41.977
Thank you.

12:42.057 --> 12:43.857
We both had formidable teams,

12:43.937 --> 12:46.897
but I was hoping
to go up against you one on one.

12:47.437 --> 12:48.737
I can hardly wait to see

12:48.817 --> 12:50.817
what next year's Chevalier
has in store.

12:50.897 --> 12:51.907
Same here.

12:51.987 --> 12:53.447
I'll be counting the days.

12:54.527 --> 12:56.947
[footsteps approaching]

12:58.747 --> 12:59.657
[BOTH] Uh.

13:00.247 --> 13:01.417
You boys need a hand?

13:02.127 --> 13:03.877
Thank you, but I'm good.

13:05.877 --> 13:08.127
Sorry, Lucas.
We beefed it for you.

13:08.207 --> 13:10.417
I guess Ray was still
that much better than us.

13:10.507 --> 13:13.597
No, you guys held your own, too.

13:14.797 --> 13:16.387
To tell you the truth,
I learned a lot

13:16.467 --> 13:18.427
from having the opportunity
to fight on a team.

13:18.977 --> 13:21.437
Having companions
isn't a bad thing.

13:21.517 --> 13:23.187
-I quite liked it.
-[both chuckle]

13:23.267 --> 13:24.977
[both groaning]

13:25.107 --> 13:27.687
-[RAY] Amelia! Ariane!
-Ray, you're...

13:27.777 --> 13:29.687
[screams] Naked!

13:29.777 --> 13:31.197
What happened to your clothes?

13:31.607 --> 13:34.657
I can explain,
but anyway, we did it.

13:34.737 --> 13:35.947
We won all because of you two.

13:36.027 --> 13:38.617
No, we won because of all of us.

13:38.697 --> 13:42.457
Yeah. As I seem to recall,
we all won the title as a team.

13:42.537 --> 13:43.707
Well, I suppose you're right.

13:44.417 --> 13:46.337
Would you please
put some clothes on already?

13:49.297 --> 13:52.967
Hmm. That's the famous
Butterfly Effect, huh?

13:53.797 --> 13:56.717
So you must be Amelia Rose.
[chuckles]

13:57.467 --> 13:59.347
This just got
a lot more interesting.

14:00.307 --> 14:02.477
[crowd chattering indistinctly]

14:02.977 --> 14:04.847
[DINA]
May I have everyone's attention?

14:04.937 --> 14:07.267
Team Algren, our champions
of the Magicks War,

14:07.357 --> 14:09.227
have officially received
their trophy.

14:10.687 --> 14:12.857
Now that the battle
for victory is over,

14:12.947 --> 14:14.317
please give
all of our contestants

14:14.407 --> 14:15.867
a huge round of applause.

14:15.947 --> 14:18.407
Team Algren, congratulations.

14:18.487 --> 14:21.867
Oh, Carocaro's getting
all choked up over here.

14:22.907 --> 14:24.667
Thank you so much.
It's an honor.

14:24.747 --> 14:26.497
-Don't thank me. You earned it.
-[REBECCA] I want to be up there

14:26.577 --> 14:27.627
next to Ray.

14:27.707 --> 14:30.757
[ABBIE] Team Forst,
you fought with great zeal.

14:30.837 --> 14:32.417
[LIESELOTTE] I knew
it would be a total blowout.

14:32.507 --> 14:33.547
[FRANCOISE] What?

14:34.217 --> 14:35.547
Let's go!

14:35.637 --> 14:36.797
Al, you're the greatest, bro!

14:36.887 --> 14:39.137
-You rocked, Evi! Ya big baby.
-I love you, man! Come on!

14:39.217 --> 14:42.097
[WANDA] Congratulations, Amelia.
You're my hero!

14:42.177 --> 14:43.267
[JERYL] So intense!

14:43.347 --> 14:45.187
[LAQUIS]
The match was the best ever!

14:46.187 --> 14:47.147
[gasps]

14:52.147 --> 14:54.237
-[ELISA] Hey, Claris.
-Huh?

14:55.897 --> 14:59.117
Sorry, I, uh,
have to get going now.

14:59.197 --> 15:00.157
[CLARIS] Uh...

15:00.237 --> 15:02.617
Also, I'm gonna take a break
from school

15:02.697 --> 15:04.407
and stay home for a while.

15:05.497 --> 15:08.077
Wait, Elisa, you...

15:08.167 --> 15:09.417
But why?

15:09.497 --> 15:12.457
Did anyone happen to see
where Pinky went off to?

15:12.547 --> 15:13.967
-Not me.
-What?

15:14.047 --> 15:14.967
[FRANCOISE] Okay, I gotta ask,

15:15.047 --> 15:16.427
why are you always
so restrained?

15:16.887 --> 15:19.637
[DINA] <i>Oh, no. Not again!</i>

15:19.717 --> 15:20.757
[CAROL] All right, folks.

15:20.887 --> 15:23.267
Wasn't that
like watching a party?

15:23.347 --> 15:24.677
Well, I got ya.

15:24.767 --> 15:27.187
To wrap up this tournament,
I'll sing a song for you.

15:27.687 --> 15:30.107
-Please, not yet.
-Come on, Abbie.

15:30.187 --> 15:31.267
[ABBIE] This isn't the time

15:31.357 --> 15:32.687
for your personal
vanity project.

15:32.777 --> 15:34.437
[CAROL]
Hey, that's totally not true.

15:34.527 --> 15:35.897
-Everyone's been waiting.
-[ABBIE] I'm sorry.

15:35.987 --> 15:37.607
I can't allow you to sing yet.

15:37.697 --> 15:40.157
[CAROL] Oh, but, but why?

15:40.237 --> 15:41.867
Come, Elisa,
it's time for us to leave.

15:43.157 --> 15:44.197
Right.

15:50.247 --> 15:51.957
♪

15:52.497 --> 15:53.587
Hmm.

15:53.707 --> 15:54.707
Peek.

15:56.127 --> 15:57.717
-[RAY] It sounds like Abbie...
-[gasps]

15:57.797 --> 15:58.967
...and Master
won't be joining us.

15:59.087 --> 16:00.217
Makes me sad, you know?

16:00.297 --> 16:02.807
I do, yeah.
I'm sad they had to leave

16:02.887 --> 16:04.967
for that Eugenics strategy
meeting, too.

16:06.767 --> 16:08.137
It's a shame
there's been an uptick

16:08.227 --> 16:09.897
in Eugenics activity.

16:09.977 --> 16:11.477
-[CAROL] Mmm.
-Carol?

16:12.057 --> 16:13.607
-Carol.
-Huh?

16:13.687 --> 16:15.487
What's wrong? I don't know.

16:15.567 --> 16:17.187
I guess it feels like
you're not quite here.

16:17.277 --> 16:18.737
That couldn't be further
from the truth.

16:18.817 --> 16:21.617
I'm right here,
your friend Carocaro.

16:21.697 --> 16:23.487
[humming]

16:24.447 --> 16:25.787
All righty, then.

16:26.287 --> 16:27.957
<i>The Hymn Festival?</i>

16:28.037 --> 16:29.117
[AMELIA] Yeah!

16:29.207 --> 16:31.497
Nothing says winter break
like the Hymn Festival.

16:31.997 --> 16:33.087
That's so true.

16:33.167 --> 16:34.747
I've heard the festival came
from a tradition

16:34.837 --> 16:35.797
where people would sing

16:35.877 --> 16:37.257
in the Arnold Kingdom's
churches.

16:38.837 --> 16:40.507
Did you hear
what changed recently?

16:40.587 --> 16:43.347
<i>It's become normal for people</i>
<i>to spend the Hymn Festival</i>

16:43.427 --> 16:46.017
<i>with their lovers rather than</i>
<i>their friends and families.</i>

16:46.097 --> 16:49.137
-Whoa.
-Yeah, so anyway.

16:49.227 --> 16:51.767
Well, as a noble
from one of the top houses,

16:51.857 --> 16:54.727
the Magic Association invited me
to their little soiree.

16:54.817 --> 16:57.777
-Would you care to--
-Wow, you know what's crazy?

16:57.857 --> 17:00.107
I got an invitation as well!

17:00.197 --> 17:02.367
As one of the
Seven Grand Sorcerers.

17:02.447 --> 17:03.907
Oh, naturally.

17:03.987 --> 17:06.407
It's a good opportunity,
so I should go.

17:06.487 --> 17:09.747
Master, Abbie, and Carol,
they'll be there with me.

17:09.827 --> 17:11.247
Ah, you don't say.

17:11.327 --> 17:12.577
-[leaves rustling]
-Hmm?

17:12.667 --> 17:13.917
[both gasp]

17:13.997 --> 17:15.917
As you probably assumed,
I was invited, too.

17:15.997 --> 17:18.007
[AMELIA]
What are you doing in there?

17:18.087 --> 17:19.417
Wouldn't you like to know?

17:19.507 --> 17:21.587
By the way, we got invited, too.

17:21.677 --> 17:24.257
For taking second place
in the Magicks War, obviously.

17:24.347 --> 17:25.307
[AMELIA] Wha?

17:25.427 --> 17:28.177
[ARIANE] Naturally,
I'll be in attendance as well.

17:28.767 --> 17:29.727
[RAY] Ariane!

17:30.767 --> 17:32.727
For real? Why are you here, too?

17:32.807 --> 17:34.187
Because I want to be.

17:34.267 --> 17:36.687
The festival will be
quite lively this year, huh?

17:36.777 --> 17:38.477
-[EVI] Yeah, it'll be fun.
-I guess so.

17:38.567 --> 17:40.437
-[REBECCA] Oh, totally.
-[AMELIA] Yay.

17:40.527 --> 17:43.817
Why are we going to Alphelia
for this year's Hymn Festival?

17:43.907 --> 17:44.817
[CAROL] Hmm.

17:44.907 --> 17:46.447
I wish I had a better answer
for you.

17:47.037 --> 17:50.747
It's a kingdom of elves,
a realm enveloped by mystery.

17:50.827 --> 17:53.207
Just six months ago,
they got a new king.

17:53.287 --> 17:55.377
So all kinds of rumors
are swirling around.

17:55.457 --> 17:56.377
I wouldn't have thought

17:56.457 --> 17:57.957
crossing the border
would even be possible.

17:59.877 --> 18:01.467
[RAY]
<i>Something is definitely off.</i>

18:02.167 --> 18:03.927
<i>It's Carol we're talking about.</i>

18:04.007 --> 18:06.427
<i>She would never be this</i>
<i>well-behaved on a fun trip.</i>

18:06.507 --> 18:07.967
Is something wrong, Ray?

18:08.387 --> 18:09.557
No, not a thing.

18:10.267 --> 18:11.727
<i>Am I dreaming?</i>

18:11.807 --> 18:14.977
<i>Or is Ray still aiming</i>
<i>his steely grey-blues at me?</i>

18:15.057 --> 18:16.397
I'm melting!

18:16.477 --> 18:19.687
<i>His gaze is burning hot,</i>
<i>and here we are all alone.</i>

18:19.817 --> 18:21.107
<i>I mean</i>,
<i>he's basically an adult now</i>

18:21.187 --> 18:22.567
<i>and he gets more dapper</i>
<i>every year.</i>

18:22.647 --> 18:23.647
<i>If I wasn't half-joking,</i>

18:23.737 --> 18:25.867
<i>hugging him would be an exercise</i>
<i>in impulse control.</i>

18:25.947 --> 18:26.867
<i>Take a breath!</i>

18:26.947 --> 18:29.117
<i>Can I alone make sure</i>
<i>he actually has fun?</i>

18:29.197 --> 18:30.117
<i>He was probably looking forward</i>

18:30.197 --> 18:31.577
<i>to going on this trip</i>
<i>with everyone.</i>

18:31.657 --> 18:33.287
<i>I'm pretty sure</i>
<i>he doesn't dislike me</i>.

18:33.367 --> 18:34.457
<i>But he always comes off</i>

18:34.537 --> 18:35.497
<i>-kinda harsh, so...</i>
-Carol? You good?

18:35.577 --> 18:38.037
[screams, groans]

18:38.127 --> 18:39.127
If you're feeling sick,

18:39.207 --> 18:41.167
we should ask them
to stop the carriage.

18:41.257 --> 18:42.377
[groans]

18:42.457 --> 18:44.127
[laughs] Never been better!

18:44.927 --> 18:47.637
-I'm in tip-top shape!
-That so?

18:49.057 --> 18:50.137
[CAROL] <i>So anyway.</i>

18:50.927 --> 18:52.097
<i>As the older woman here,</i>

18:52.177 --> 18:54.477
<i>it's up to me</i>
<i>to take the lead on this trip.</i>

18:55.227 --> 18:56.307
[horse neighing]

19:01.727 --> 19:02.687
Oh, wow.

19:02.777 --> 19:05.527
It'll take another half day
to get to Alphelia,

19:05.607 --> 19:08.407
so let's stay for the night
and rest up while we can.

19:10.237 --> 19:11.657
[RAY] What a lovely room.

19:14.077 --> 19:15.657
[RAY]
<i>Man, the view is beautiful, too.</i>

19:16.917 --> 19:20.247
<i>Thing is, I wasn't expecting</i>
<i>to share a room.</i>

19:21.247 --> 19:23.047
[grumbles]

19:23.127 --> 19:26.177
<i>I sure as heck wasn't expecting</i>
<i>there to be a booking mistake,</i>

19:26.257 --> 19:27.257
<i>but here we are.</i>

19:28.257 --> 19:30.717
-The food was delicious.
-Mm-hmm.

19:31.887 --> 19:34.177
<i>It's crazy</i>
<i>how much Ray's grown up.</i>

19:34.267 --> 19:37.687
<i>He was just an adorable</i>
<i>little powerhouse back then.</i>

19:37.767 --> 19:41.727
<i>And now, look how mature</i>
<i>and cool he is.</i>

19:41.817 --> 19:43.687
Guess we'll go back to our room
and take a bath?

19:43.777 --> 19:44.817
[gasps]

19:45.187 --> 19:46.817
Uh, Carol?

19:46.897 --> 19:48.527
What are you thinking
about right now?

19:49.237 --> 19:50.197
[gasps]

19:50.277 --> 19:52.867
Oh, just that
you should take a bath first.

19:52.947 --> 19:54.997
No, I think it's you
who should get in first.

19:55.077 --> 19:55.997
[Carol laughs]

19:56.077 --> 19:58.457
But I take so long,
and what does that do for you?

19:58.577 --> 20:00.337
I'll take your finished plates
if you'd like.

20:00.417 --> 20:01.337
Uh, yeah, sure.

20:01.797 --> 20:02.837
Mm.

20:03.917 --> 20:04.837
What's wrong?

20:04.917 --> 20:07.257
-[WAITRESS] Pardon me.
-Appreciate it.

20:07.337 --> 20:08.587
You're the best. Thanks.

20:08.717 --> 20:11.217
But getting in first is, like,
so embarrassing.

20:11.297 --> 20:13.807
You bathing
in the water that I was just in.

20:13.887 --> 20:15.517
Would either of you
like some water?

20:15.597 --> 20:16.927
-[RAY] Uh...
-We're fine, thanks.

20:19.477 --> 20:21.857
You getting in after
I just bathed would mean...

20:22.227 --> 20:23.147
Hmm?

20:25.227 --> 20:26.817
Sorry for being inconsiderate.

20:26.897 --> 20:28.237
Please, I'll go first, okay?

20:31.527 --> 20:32.827
You're the best, Ray.

20:34.157 --> 20:35.737
[Carol humming]

20:42.957 --> 20:44.997
[continues humming]

20:52.967 --> 20:54.507
<i>Did she fall asleep already?</i>

20:56.427 --> 20:59.517
[CLARIS] Hey, Ray,
something's up with Elisa.

20:59.597 --> 21:01.017
She's been taking
time off school

21:01.097 --> 21:02.647
because of problems at home,
I think.

21:02.727 --> 21:04.017
I guess.

21:04.107 --> 21:06.687
She's just acting preoccupied
with something.

21:06.777 --> 21:08.147
I'm worried for her.

21:08.237 --> 21:10.197
Yeah, I know what you mean.

21:10.277 --> 21:11.447
The last time you saw her,

21:11.527 --> 21:12.867
she was picked up
by an elf, right?

21:12.947 --> 21:13.907
[CLARIS] Yeah.

21:13.987 --> 21:15.987
I'm certain that's what I saw.

21:17.237 --> 21:18.247
Hmm.

21:26.297 --> 21:27.247
[GEKKO] Yamo.

21:31.257 --> 21:34.427
I'm to assist
with Ray White's awakening.

21:34.507 --> 21:36.467
That's what the higher-ups
want anyway.

21:37.467 --> 21:39.807
But truth be told,
my real goal is...

21:39.887 --> 21:41.017
[Bianca gasps]

21:41.767 --> 21:44.687
Uh... Oh, it's a face mask.

21:44.767 --> 21:47.437
-[humming]
-[Bianca scoffs]

21:48.357 --> 21:50.107
Ugh, damn it.

21:50.187 --> 21:52.357
My motivation's dropped
below zero.

21:52.987 --> 21:53.947
Oh, well.

21:54.027 --> 21:55.697
The consecrated grounds
come first.

21:56.407 --> 21:58.197
How are things going with you?

21:58.287 --> 21:59.947
[PUKKAPUKA]
Everything's going swimmingly.

22:00.037 --> 22:00.947
'Kay.

22:04.537 --> 22:07.377
♪

22:10.007 --> 22:11.797
[CAROL] Wow, it's so pretty.

22:11.917 --> 22:13.797
[RAY] This is Alphelia, huh?

22:13.887 --> 22:15.887
[CAROL] I still can't
believe this is real.

22:15.967 --> 22:17.467
[RAY] I assume
it wasn't always like this.

22:18.097 --> 22:20.177
Change the king,
change the city.

22:21.347 --> 22:23.227
[CAROL]
That's very gentlemanly of you.

22:23.767 --> 22:26.057
-Welcome to our country.
-[BOTH] Huh?

22:26.147 --> 22:27.767
We've been waiting for you, Ray.

22:27.857 --> 22:29.977
This is a special day for us.

22:30.067 --> 22:31.817
I'm Mia, and I've been entrusted

22:31.897 --> 22:33.487
with escorting you
to the mansion.

22:33.567 --> 22:35.867
It's an honor
to assist you both.

22:35.947 --> 22:38.737
I was commanded to hurry
and report to you two posthaste.

22:39.907 --> 22:41.247
Oh.

22:41.867 --> 22:43.997
[MIA] We have arrived
at your destination.

22:44.367 --> 22:45.627
[door opens]

22:47.087 --> 22:48.497
[MIA] They're here, madam.

22:57.097 --> 22:58.637
-Elisa?
-What?

23:00.467 --> 23:01.517
[ELISA] Hey, Ray.

23:03.227 --> 23:06.187
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:48.857 --> 23:50.357
[CAROL] <i>This song's for you,</i>
<i>and it's a preview.</i>

23:50.437 --> 23:52.067
<i>-Elisa here.</i>
<i>-And Mia, too.</i>

23:52.147 --> 23:53.817
<i>I'm the hero, the star,</i>
<i>Carocaro!</i>

23:53.897 --> 23:55.527
<i>Hey, you two,</i>
<i>tell me about this preview.</i>

23:55.607 --> 23:56.527
[MIA] <i>No, we're through.</i>

23:56.607 --> 23:57.947
[CAROL]
<i>Oh, me too? Hey, look at you.</i>

23:58.027 --> 23:59.567
<i>Elisa, your outfit's fire,</i>

23:59.657 --> 24:00.577
<i>-no drama.</i>
-[ELISA] <i>Ba-dump, wee!</i>

24:00.657 --> 24:01.617
[CAROL] <i>Was that sound</i>
<i>your heartbeat?</i>

24:01.697 --> 24:03.157
<i>-Oh, yeah!</i>
-[MIA] <i>Next time on,</i>

24:03.237 --> 24:05.327
[ELISA] The Iceblade Sorcerer
Shall Rule the World.

24:05.407 --> 24:06.657
[ALL] Two!

24:07.247 --> 24:09.127
[CAROL]
<i>"Love You Tender, episode five."</i>

24:09.207 --> 24:11.587
[ELISA]<i>"The Boy Who Is the</i>
<i>World's Strongest Sorcerer...</i>

24:11.667 --> 24:12.587
[CAROL] ...<i>Goes on a Date</i>

24:12.667 --> 24:14.127
<i>With That Girl</i>
<i>In a Foreign Land?"</i>
